# Secrets
# This file must stay tracked. It is the only secret protection a fresh clone gets,
# and every example directory asks contributors to drop real keys into secret/.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secret/
fordefi_secret/
*.pem
*.key
agent-private-key*.json
# Public keys are legitimately tracked (webhook/API-approver signature verification).
!*public_key*.pem
!*public*.pem

